{"id":"8c2be80a12f6ee89","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-kleene-second-recursion.md","title":"Kleene's Second Recursion Theorem","display":"thm-kleene-second-recursion — Kleene's Second Recursion Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-kleene-second-recursion","aliases":["90-thm-kleene-second-recursion"],"display":"thm-kleene-second-recursion — Kleene's Second Recursion Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursion-theorem]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-thm-smn]]","[[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-kleene-second-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-kleene-second-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-second-recursion — Kleene's Second Recursion Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40d9084cba778b26\" href=\"?note=40d9084cba778b26\" title=\"90-df-recursion-theorem\">90-df-recursion-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b8b8df152b92c5d9\" href=\"?note=b8b8df152b92c5d9\" title=\"90-thm-recursion-theorem\">90-thm-recursion-theorem</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定编号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 及部分函数等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li>要求 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span>；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_2\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq F(e,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_2\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq F(e,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的二元索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(n)=s(a,n)\">\\(c(n)=s(a,n)\\)</span> 是全递归索引变换，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{c(n)}(x)\\simeq F(n,x)\">\\(\\varphi_{c(n)}(x)\\simeq F(n,x)\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b8b8df152b92c5d9\" href=\"?note=b8b8df152b92c5d9\" title=\"90-thm-recursion-theorem\">90-thm-recursion-theorem</a> 即得所求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 仍是二元部分递归函数，不引入高阶泛函，也不加强为全函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"40d9084cba778b26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"b8b8df152b92c5d9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定编号族 $\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}$、$\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}$ 及部分函数等号 $\\simeq$ 见 [[90-df-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":